{"id":"autorisation","lemma":"autorisation","pos":"noun","rank":1971,"glosses":["authorization (act of authorizing)","authorization (attestation of authorization)"],"ipa":"/o.tɔ.ʁi.za.sjɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/dd/Fr-autorisation.ogg/Fr-autorisation.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"autorisations"},"formAudio":{"autorisations":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2f/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-autorisations.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Il nous faut une autorisation.","en":"We need authorization.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to need","l":"falloir"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Tu as l'autorisation de le rencontrer.","en":"You may meet him.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to meet"}]},{"text":"Que feras-tu si je ne te donne pas mon autorisation ?","en":"What'll you do if I don't give you my permission?","words":[{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to give","l":"donner"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Tom a l'autorisation de le faire.","en":"Tom is authorized to do this.","words":[null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to do"}]},{"text":"Vous ne pouvez pas pénétrer dans le bâtiment sans autorisation.","en":"You can't enter the building without a permit.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to enter, to get in"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"building, edifice"},{"g":"without"},null]}]}